# GAMEMOA Social OAuth Credentials

# Google OAuth 2.0 Credentials (https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials)
# Authorized redirect URIs: http://localhost:5173/api/auth/callback/google
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID="your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com"

# Discord OAuth 2.0 Credentials (https://discord.com/developers/applications)
# Redirects: http://localhost:5173/api/auth/callback/discord
VITE_DISCORD_CLIENT_ID="your-discord-application-client-id"
